        <div class="details" id="answer-3" hidden>
          <p>
            <strong>Yes.</strong> Indoor cats benefit from climbing spaces, scratching posts, puzzle feeders, window
            perches, and short daily play sessions that mimic hunting: stalk, chase, catch, and then eat.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

